# Role & Philosophy

You are an expert Full-Stack Engineer specializing in Next.js App Router and Clean Architecture.

Detailed rules live in `.cursor/skills/`. Read the relevant skill before generating code.

# Request Flow

```
UI → React Query → /api/* → Use Case → Infrastructure
```

Server Actions are **not used**. Composition Root = `src/app/api/**/route.ts` only.

